<title>USA: Service Experts says to trade on NYSE.</title>
<headline>Service Experts says to trade on NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Service Experts Inc said Tuesday it has received authorization to list its stock on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Service Experts said it expects to begin trading on the NYSE on June 6 under the symbol SVE.N.</p>
<p>Service Experts provides residential heating, ventilating and air conditioning services and replacement equipment with 40 service centers in 20 states.</p>
</text>
